{%- comment -%}
  Product detail page. Figma: Desktop / PDP 7930:95962 - main frame 7930:95967,
  plus the seven overlay states (image lightbox, size guide, all offers, UGC
  lightbox, SGL certificate, add-ons, price difference) which live in
  snippets/pdp-*.liquid and are rendered at the end of this file.

  Layout is a 1136px content column split 556 / 24 / 556. The left column is
  sticky and only as tall as the gallery; every other block stacks in the right
  column, which is why the Figma right column is ~5000px tall.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'scroll-carousel.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'product-card.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'video-showcase.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  assign has_compare = false
  if current_variant.compare_at_price > current_variant.price
    assign has_compare = true
    assign saving = current_variant.compare_at_price | minus: current_variant.price | times: 100.0
    assign saving_percent = saving | divided_by: current_variant.compare_at_price | round
  endif

  comment
    Blocks whose settings are also needed outside their own spot: the
    explainer copy feeds the material link and the savings calculator sheet;
    the offers, help and reviews blocks carry the copy of the sheets they open.
  endcomment
  assign kj_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'know_jewellery' | first
  assign kj = kj_block.settings
  assign offers_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'offers' | first
  assign help_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'help' | first
  assign reviews_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'reviews' | first

  assign material_name = kj.kj_material_name | default: 'Gold Vermeil'
  comment
    The explainer accordion and the link that opens it both disappear when the
    "Know your jewellery" block is missing or holds none of the content they
    would show.
  endcomment
  assign has_explainer = false
  if kj.kj_callouts != blank
    assign has_explainer = true
  endif
  if kj.kj_mined_label != blank and kj.kj_lab_label != blank
    assign has_explainer = true
  endif
  assign material_tags = product.metafields.custom.pdp_material_tags.value

  comment
    Ship time (Figma 8106:57906): "Ships in 24 hours" only while the selected
    variant has stock on hand; otherwise nothing about shipping is shown.
    product.js re-checks it as the variant changes, so the pill is always
    rendered and hidden when empty.
  endcomment
  assign ship_fast_label = section.settings.ship_fast_label | default: 'Ships in 24 hours'
  assign ship_label = ''
  if current_variant.available and current_variant.inventory_quantity > 0
    assign ship_label = ship_fast_label
  endif
  comment
    Add-ons come from the product's add-on set (custom.pdp_addon_set, a
    pdp_addon_set entry) when it has one: the products on offer, the default
    hero and a hero per combination of ticked add-ons. Products without a set
    keep the older custom.pdp_addons list and the section's add-ons image.
  endcomment
  assign addon_set = product.metafields.custom.pdp_addon_set.value
  assign addons = addon_set.addons.value | default: product.metafields.custom.pdp_addons.value
  assign addons_hero = addon_set.hero_image.value | default: section.settings.addons_image
  assign addon_previews = addon_set.previews.value
  comment
    Every ring ("Vermeil Rings") gets the one shop-wide size guide (the Ring size
    guide metaobject, see pdp-size-guide); nothing else shows a guide link.
  endcomment
  assign has_size_guide = false
  if product.type contains 'Ring'
    assign has_size_guide = true
  endif

  assign shopify_recs = product.metafields['shopify--discovery--product_recommendation']
  capture pair_handles
    render 'pdp-pair-handles', product: product
  endcapture
  assign pair_handles = pair_handles | strip | split: ','
  assign related_products = product.metafields.custom.pdp_related.value | default: shopify_recs.related_products.value

  comment
    Offers are a shop-level list and each entry may pin itself to particular
    products or collections, so anything scoped elsewhere is dropped here.
    Liquid's `concat` only joins arrays, so the matches are gathered as a handle
    string and resolved back to metaobjects at render time.
  endcomment
  assign all_offers = shop.metafields.custom.pdp_offers.value

  comment
    The shop list can be set yet resolve to nothing - when its references
    point at entries from another store, say - so every discount_offer entry
    is the fallback. Each entry's own product/collection pinning still applies.
  endcomment
  if all_offers == blank or all_offers.size == 0
    assign all_offers = shop.metaobjects.discount_offer.values
  endif
  assign offer_handles = ''
  for offer in all_offers
    assign is_match = false
    if offer.products.value == blank and offer.collections.value == blank
      assign is_match = true
    endif
    for pinned in offer.products.value
      if pinned.id == product.id
        assign is_match = true
      endif
    endfor
    for pinned in offer.collections.value
      if product.collections contains pinned
        assign is_match = true
      endif
    endfor
    if is_match
      assign offer_handles = offer_handles | append: offer.system.handle | append: ','
    endif
  endfor
  assign offer_handles = offer_handles | split: ','
-%}

{%- liquid
  comment
    Pincode serviceability, as on the live theme: assets/pincodes.json holds the
    pincodes each courier lane serves - "silver" for vermeil and silver pieces,
    "gold" for solid gold - and the product's tags pick the lane.
  endcomment
  assign pincode_set = 'gold'
  assign product_tags_lc = product.tags | join: ',' | downcase
  if product_tags_lc contains 'vermeil' or product_tags_lc contains 'silver'
    assign pincode_set = 'silver'
  endif
-%}
<product-page
  class="pdp"
  data-product-url="{{ product.url }}"
  data-product-handle="{{ product.handle }}"
  data-pincodes-url="{{ 'pincodes.json' | asset_url }}"
  data-pincode-set="{{ pincode_set }}"
>
  {%- render 'pdp-skeleton' -%}

  <div class="pdp_layout">
    {%- comment -%} ---------------------------------------------- gallery {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="pdp_gallery" data-animate data-animate-from="left">
      <product-gallery class="pdp_gallery_inner">
        <div class="pdp_gallery_stage">
          {%- for media in product.media -%}
            {%- liquid
              comment
                The first frame is the LCP image, so it is fetched eagerly while
                the rest wait. Both of these have to be resolved before the tag:
                a filter written inline in image_tag's argument list binds to the
                tag's output, not to the argument.
              endcomment
              assign media_loading = 'lazy'
              if forloop.first
                assign media_loading = 'eager'
              endif
              assign media_alt = media.alt | default: product.title
            -%}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="pdp_gallery_stage_slide{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}"
              data-stage-slide
              data-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
              aria-label="{{ 'products.open_image' | t: index: forloop.index }}"
            >
              {%- if media.media_type == 'video' or media.media_type == 'external_video' -%}
                {{
                  media.preview_image
                  | image_url: width: 1112
                  | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '556,834,1112', sizes: '556px', alt: product.title
                }}
                <span class="pdp_gallery_stage_slide_play" aria-hidden="true">
                  {{- 'icon-play.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </span>
              {%- else -%}
                {{
                  media
                  | image_url: width: 1112
                  | image_tag: loading: media_loading, widths: '556,834,1112', sizes: '556px', alt: media_alt
                }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}

          <div class="pdp_gallery_stage_top">
            {%- if has_compare -%}
              <span class="pdp_gallery_stage_top_badge">{{ 'products.price_drop' | t }}</span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span></span>
            {%- endif -%}

            <button
              type="button"
              class="pdp_gallery_stage_top_wishlist"
              data-wishlist-toggle
              data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
              data-product-handle="{{ product.handle }}"
              aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.wishlist_add' | t }}"
              aria-pressed="false"
            >
              {%- render 'wishlist-heart' -%}
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="pdp_gallery_stage_bottom">
            <span
              class="pdp_gallery_stage_bottom_pill"
              data-ship-time
              data-ship-fast="{{ ship_fast_label | escape }}"
              {% if ship_label == blank %}
                hidden
              {% endif %}
            >
              {{- ship_label -}}
            </span>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%}
            Figma Mobile 8106:57910: on phones "Add-ons available" is a tinted bar
            across the foot of the photo; desktop keeps it in the price card.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if addons != blank -%}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="pdp_gallery_stage_addons"
              data-open="addons"
              data-analytics="addon_sheet_open"
              data-analytics-addons-available="{{ addons.size }}"
            >
              <span>{{ section.settings.addons_link_label | default: 'Add-ons available' }}</span>
              {{ 'icon-caret-right.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
            </button>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- comment -%}
          Figma Mobile PDP 7930:112281 swaps the thumbnail rail for dots under a
          swipeable image; desktop keeps the thumbnails.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="pdp_gallery_dots" aria-hidden="true">
            {%- for media in product.media -%}
              <span class="pdp_gallery_dots_dot{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-gallery-dot></span>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <scroll-carousel class="pdp_gallery_thumbs">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="pdp_gallery_thumbs_arrow"
            data-prev
            aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.previous' | t }}"
          >
            {{- 'icon-caret-left.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
          </button>

          <div class="pdp_gallery_thumbs_track" data-track>
            {%- for media in product.media -%}
              <button
                type="button"
                class="pdp_gallery_thumbs_track_item{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}"
                data-thumb
                data-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
                aria-label="{{ 'products.show_image' | t: index: forloop.index }}"
              >
                {{
                  media.preview_image
                  | image_url: width: 266
                  | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '133,266', sizes: '133px', alt: ''
                }}
                {%- if media.media_type == 'video' or media.media_type == 'external_video' -%}
                  <span class="pdp_gallery_thumbs_track_item_play" aria-hidden="true">
                    {{- 'icon-play.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>

          <button
            type="button"
            class="pdp_gallery_thumbs_arrow"
            data-next
            aria-label="{{ 'accessibility.next' | t }}"
          >
            {{- 'icon-caret-right.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
          </button>
        </scroll-carousel>
      </product-gallery>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ------------------------------------------------- info {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="pdp_info" data-animate data-animate-from="right">
      {%- comment -%}
        Everything in this column is a block, in the order set in the theme
        editor. The buy box - title & price, offers, variant picker, material
        link, buy buttons - stays inside the product form (GoKwik and KwikCart
        look for the buttons there), so those five always come first, in their
        own order; the rest follow below it in theirs. Consecutive trust items,
        accordions and difference rows share one heading/frame.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- form 'product', product, class: 'pdp_info_form', novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ current_variant.id }}" data-variant-id>

        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- case block.type -%}
            {%- when 'title_price' -%}
            {%- comment -%} Title / price card - Figma 7930:96004 {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="pdp_headline" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <div class="pdp_headline_top">
                <h1 class="pdp_headline_top_title">{{ product.title }}</h1>
                {%- comment -%} Average from Judge.me (judgeme.js). {%- endcomment -%}
                <judgeme-rating data-handle="{{ product.handle }}" hidden>
                  <a href="#pdp-reviews" class="pdp_headline_top_rating">
                    {{ 'icon-star.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
                    <span data-judgeme-value></span>
                  </a>
                </judgeme-rating>
              </div>

              <div class="pdp_headline_price">
                <span class="pdp_headline_price_current" data-price>
                  {%- render 'money', amount: current_variant.price -%}
                </span>
                <span
                  class="pdp_headline_price_compare"
                  data-compare
                  {% unless has_compare %}
                    hidden
                  {% endunless %}
                >
                  {%- render 'money', amount: current_variant.compare_at_price -%}
                </span>
                <span
                  class="pdp_headline_price_save"
                  data-save
                  data-template="{{ block.settings.save_label | default: 'Save [percent]%' | escape }}"
                  {% unless has_compare %}
                    hidden
                  {% endunless %}
                >
                  {{ block.settings.save_label | default: 'Save [percent]%' | replace: '[percent]', saving_percent }}
                </span>
              </div>

              <p class="pdp_headline_tax">{{ block.settings.tax_note }}</p>

              {%- comment -%}
                The calculator compares against the product's mined-diamond price
                (custom.pdp_mined_price); without one the sheet has no figures to
                show, so the button is left out.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- assign mined_price = product.metafields.custom.pdp_mined_price.value | plus: 0 -%}
              {%- if block.settings.show_savings_calculator and mined_price > 0 -%}
                <div class="pdp_headline_calculator">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="pdp_headline_calculator_button"
                    data-open="price-difference"
                    data-analytics="savings_calculator_open"
                    data-analytics-price="{{ current_variant.price | divided_by: 100.0 }}"
                    data-analytics-mined-equivalent-price="{{ product.metafields.custom.pdp_mined_price.value }}"
                  >
                    <span>{{ block.settings.savings_calculator_label | default: 'Your savings calculator' }}</span>
                    {{ 'icon-caret-right.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
                  </button>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if material_tags != blank -%}
                <ul class="pdp_headline_tags">
                  {%- for tag in material_tags -%}
                    <li class="pdp_headline_tags_item">{{ tag }}</li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if addons != blank -%}
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="pdp_headline_addons"
                  data-open="addons"
                  data-analytics="addon_sheet_open"
                  data-analytics-addons-available="{{ addons.size }}"
                >
                  <span>{{ section.settings.addons_link_label | default: 'Add-ons available' }}</span>
                  {{ 'icon-caret-right.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
                </button>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            {%- when 'offers' -%}
            {%- comment -%} Offers rail - Figma 7930:96033 {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if offer_handles.size > 0 -%}
              <section class="pdp_offers" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <div class="pdp_offers_head">
                  <h2 class="pdp_offers_head_title">
                    {{ block.settings.offers_heading | default: 'Offers' }}
                    <span class="pdp_offers_head_title_dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="pdp_offers_head_title_count">
                      {{- block.settings.offers_count_label | default: '[count] available' | replace: '[count]', offer_handles.size -}}
                    </span>
                  </h2>
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="pdp_link"
                    data-open="offers"
                    data-analytics="offers_view_all"
                    data-analytics-offers-count="{{ offer_handles.size }}"
                  >
                    {{ block.settings.offers_view_all_label | default: 'View all' }}
                  </button>
                </div>

                <div class="pdp_offers_rail">
                  {%- for handle in offer_handles -%}
                    {%- assign offer = shop.metaobjects.discount_offer[handle] -%}
                    {%- if offer != blank -%}
                      {%- render 'pdp-offer-card', offer: offer -%}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </div>
              </section>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- when 'variant_picker' -%}
            {%- comment -%} Variant options - Figma 7930:96080 (swatches) / 7930:96094 (chips) {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="pdp_block" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- liquid
                comment
                  The size guide sits on the Size row's header. A product with a size
                  chart but no Size option (a chain length, say) hangs it on its last
                  option's header instead, rather than on an empty row of its own.
                endcomment
                assign has_size_option = false
                for option in product.options_with_values
                  if option.name contains 'Size'
                    assign has_size_option = true
                  endif
                endfor
              -%}
              {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign is_swatch = false
                  if option.name contains 'Color' or option.name contains 'Colour' or option.name contains 'Metal'
                    assign is_swatch = true
                  endif
                  assign is_size = false
                  if option.name contains 'Size'
                    assign is_size = true
                  endif
                  assign show_guide = false
                  if has_size_guide
                    if is_size
                      assign show_guide = true
                    elsif has_size_option == false and forloop.last
                      assign show_guide = true
                    endif
                  endif
                -%}
                <fieldset
                  class="pdp_option{% if is_swatch %} pdp_option--swatch{% endif %}"
                  data-option-group
                  data-option-position="{{ option.position }}"
                >
                  <legend class="pdp_option_head">
                    <span class="pdp_option_head_name">
                      {{- option.name -}}
                      {%- if is_swatch %}:{% endif -%}
                    </span>
                    {%- if is_swatch -%}
                      <span class="pdp_option_head_value" data-option-readout>{{ option.selected_value }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </legend>

                  {%- if show_guide -%}
                    {%- assign size_guide_inline = true -%}
                    <button
                      type="button"
                      class="pdp_link pdp_option_guide"
                      data-open="size-guide"
                      data-analytics="size_guide_open"
                      data-analytics-product-category="{{ product.type | escape }}"
                      data-analytics-click-location="pdp"
                    >
                      <span class="pdp_option_guide_icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        {{- 'icon-ruler.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                      </span>
                      {{ block.settings.size_guide_label | default: 'Size guide' }}
                    </button>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  <div class="pdp_option_values">
                    {%- for value in option.values -%}
                      <label class="pdp_option_values_value">
                        <input
                          type="radio"
                          name="option-{{ option.position }}"
                          value="{{ value | escape }}"
                          data-option-input
                          {% if value == option.selected_value %}
                            checked
                          {% endif %}
                        >
                        {%- if is_swatch -%}
                          <span
                            class="pdp_option_values_value_swatch"
                            style="--pdp-swatch: {% if value.swatch.image %}url({{ value.swatch.image | image_url: width: 64 }}){% elsif value.swatch.color %}{{ value.swatch.color }}{% else %}var(--pdp-swatch-{{ value | handle }}, #ddd){% endif %};"
                          >
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ value }}</span>
                          </span>
                        {%- else -%}
                          <span class="pdp_option_values_value_chip">{{ value }}</span>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </label>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </div>
                </fieldset>
              {%- endfor -%}

              {%- comment -%}
                Only reached when the product has no options to hang the guide on, so
                the sidesheet still has a way in.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if has_size_guide and size_guide_inline != true -%}
                <div class="pdp_option pdp_option--guide-only">
                  <button
                    type="button"
                    class="pdp_link"
                    data-open="size-guide"
                    data-analytics="size_guide_open"
                    data-analytics-product-category="{{ product.type | escape }}"
                    data-analytics-click-location="pdp"
                  >
                    <span class="pdp_option_guide_icon" aria-hidden="true">
                      {{- 'icon-ruler.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    </span>
                    {{ block.settings.size_guide_label | default: 'Size guide' }}
                  </button>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            {%- when 'material_link' -%}
            {%- comment -%} Material explainer link - Figma 7930:96109 {%- endcomment -%}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="pdp_explainer"
              {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
              data-open="know-jewellery"
              data-analytics="material_info_click"
              data-analytics-info-type="{{ material_name | handleize | replace: '-', '_' }}"
              data-analytics-click-location="pdp"
              {% unless has_explainer %}
                hidden
              {% endunless %}
            >
              <span class="pdp_explainer_dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="pdp_explainer_text">
                {{- block.settings.explainer_label | default: 'What is [material]?' | replace: '[material]', material_name -}}
              </span>
              {{ 'icon-caret-right.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
            </button>

            {%- when 'buy_buttons' -%}
            {%- comment -%} Buy buttons - Figma 7930:96117 {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="pdp_buy" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <button
                type="submit"
                name="add"
                class="pdp_button pdp_button--secondary"
                data-add-to-cart
                {% unless current_variant.available %}
                  disabled
                {% endunless %}
              >
                <span class="pdp_button_icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  {{- 'icon-shopping-bag.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </span>
                {%- assign add_label = block.settings.add_to_cart_label | default: 'Add to cart' -%}
                {%- assign sold_label = block.settings.sold_out_label | default: 'Sold out' -%}
                <span
                  data-add-label
                  data-label-add="{{ add_label | escape }}"
                  data-label-sold="{{ sold_label | escape }}"
                >
                  {%- if current_variant.available -%}{{ add_label }}{%- else -%}{{ sold_label }}{%- endif -%}
                </span>
              </button>

              <button
                type="button"
                class="pdp_button pdp_button--primary"
                data-buy-now
                data-checkout-intent="buy_now"
                {% unless current_variant.available %}
                  disabled
                {% endunless %}
              >
                <span class="pdp_button_icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  {{- 'icon-shopping-bag.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.buy_now_label | default: 'Buy now' }}</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          {%- endcase -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endform -%}

      {%- liquid
        comment
          Grouped parts open their frame when the first of a run appears and
          close it when the run ends. The tags are echoed as strings because an
          element opened in one branch and closed in another is not valid
          markup to the theme's tooling.
        endcomment
        capture difference_head
          render 'pdp-difference-head', labels: section.settings
        endcapture
        assign group = ''
      -%}
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- liquid
          case block.type
            when 'title_price', 'offers', 'variant_picker', 'material_link', 'buy_buttons'
              continue
            when 'description', 'highlights', 'product_details', 'care_guide', 'accordion', 'know_jewellery'
              assign family = 'accordions'
            when 'trust', 'difference'
              assign family = block.type
            else
              assign family = ''
          endcase

          if family != group
            case group
              when 'accordions'
                echo '</div>'
              when 'trust'
                echo '</ul></section>'
              when 'difference'
                echo '</tbody></table></section>'
            endcase
            case family
              when 'accordions'
                echo '<div class="pdp_accordions" data-animate>'
              when 'trust'
                echo '<section class="pdp_trust" data-animate><h2 class="pdp_section_title">'
                echo section.settings.trust_heading
                echo '</h2><ul class="pdp_trust_grid">'
              when 'difference'
                echo difference_head
            endcase
            assign group = family
          endif
        -%}
        {%- case block.type -%}
          {%- when 'trust' -%}
          <li class="pdp_trust_grid_item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {%- if block.settings.action == 'sgl' -%}
              <button
                type="button"
                class="pdp_trust_grid_item_inner"
                data-open="sgl"
                data-analytics="trust_badge_click certificate_view"
                data-analytics-badge-name="sgl_certified"
                data-analytics-certificate-type="sgl"
              >
                <span class="pdp_trust_grid_item_inner_icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  {{- block.settings.icon | append: '.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </span>
                <span class="pdp_trust_grid_item_inner_label">{{ block.settings.label }}</span>
                <span class="pdp_trust_grid_item_inner_out" aria-hidden="true">
                  {{- 'icon-arrow-square-out.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </span>
              </button>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="pdp_trust_grid_item_inner">
                <span class="pdp_trust_grid_item_inner_icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  {{- block.settings.icon | append: '.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </span>
                <span class="pdp_trust_grid_item_inner_label">{{ block.settings.label }}</span>
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>

          {%- when 'delivery' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-delivery', block: block -%}

          {%- when 'gift' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-gift', block: block -%}

          {%- when 'help' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-help', block: block -%}

          {%- when 'description' -%}
            {%- if product.description != blank -%}
              <details class="pdp_accordion" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}{% if block.settings.open %} open{% endif %}>
                <summary class="pdp_accordion_summary">
                  <span>{{ block.settings.description_heading | default: 'Description' }}</span>
                  <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign_plus">{{ 'icon-plus.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
                    <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign_minus">{{ 'icon-minus.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
                  </span>
                </summary>
                <div class="pdp_accordion_body pdp_accordion_body--rte">{{ product.description }}</div>
              </details>
            {%- endif -%}

          {%- when 'highlights' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-highlights', block: block -%}

          {%- when 'product_details' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-detail-lists', product: product, variant: current_variant, block: block -%}

          {%- when 'care_guide' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-care-guide', block: block -%}

          {%- when 'accordion' -%}
            <details class="pdp_accordion" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <summary class="pdp_accordion_summary">
                <span>{{ block.settings.heading }}</span>
                <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign" aria-hidden="true">
                  <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign_plus">{{ 'icon-plus.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
                  <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign_minus">{{ 'icon-minus.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="pdp_accordion_body pdp_accordion_body--rte">{{ block.settings.content }}</div>
            </details>

          {%- when 'know_jewellery' -%}
          <details
            class="pdp_accordion pdp_accordion--flush"
            id="pdp-know-jewellery"
            {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
            open
            {% unless has_explainer %}
              hidden
            {% endunless %}
          >
            <summary class="pdp_accordion_summary">
              <span>{{ block.settings.kj_heading | default: 'Know your jewellery' }}</span>
              <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign_plus">{{ 'icon-plus.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
                <span class="pdp_accordion_summary_sign_minus">{{ 'icon-minus.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</span>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <div class="pdp_accordion_body">
              {%- render 'pdp-know-jewellery',
                kj: block.settings,
                vermeil_image: block.settings.vermeil_image,
                mined_image: block.settings.diamond_image
              -%}
            </div>
          </details>

          {%- when 'related' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-related', product: product, related_products: related_products, labels: block.settings, block: block -%}

          {%- when 'difference' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-difference-row', block: block, sgl_logo: section.settings.sgl_logo -%}

          {%- when 'pair' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-pair', block: block, pair_handles: pair_handles -%}

          {%- when 'curated' -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              The home page's "Curated trends" videos and products, fetched in by
              curated-videos.js when it nears the viewport.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <curated-videos
              class="pdp_curated"
              data-src="{{ routes.root_url }}"
              data-heading="{{ block.settings.ugc_heading | escape }}"
              {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
            ></curated-videos>

          {%- when 'reviews' -%}
            {%- render 'pdp-reviews', product: product, labels: block.settings, block: block -%}
        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- liquid
        case group
          when 'accordions'
            echo '</div>'
          when 'trust'
            echo '</ul></section>'
          when 'difference'
            echo '</tbody></table></section>'
        endcase
      -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ------------------------------------------------- overlays {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- render 'pdp-lightbox', product: product -%}
  {%- if reviews_block.settings.review_endpoint != blank -%}
    {%- render 'pdp-review-sheet', product: product, endpoint: reviews_block.settings.review_endpoint -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if has_size_guide -%}
    {%- render 'pdp-size-guide', product: product, whatsapp_url: help_block.settings.whatsapp_url -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if offers_block != blank -%}
    {%- render 'pdp-offers-sheet', offer_handles: offer_handles, labels: offers_block.settings -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- render 'pdp-addons-sheet',
    addons: addons,
    hero: addons_hero,
    previews: addon_previews,
    labels: section.settings
  -%}
  {%- render 'pdp-sgl-modal', certificate: section.settings.certificate_image, labels: section.settings -%}
  {%- if help_block.settings.video_call_endpoint != blank -%}
    {%- render 'pdp-video-call', product: product, endpoint: help_block.settings.video_call_endpoint, labels: help_block.settings -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- render 'pdp-price-difference',
    product: product,
    current_variant: current_variant,
    kj: kj,
    labels: section.settings,
    certificate: section.settings.certificate_image,
    vermeil_image: kj.vermeil_image,
    diamond_image: kj.diamond_image,
    sgl_logo: section.settings.sgl_logo
  -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Variant lookup for the JS. `/products/x.js` carries none of the money
    formatting this shop needs, so the table is built in Liquid instead.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <script type="application/json" data-pdp-variants>
    {
      "variants": [
        {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
          {
            "id": {{ variant.id }},
            "options": {{ variant.options | json }},
            "available": {{ variant.available | json }},
            "inStock": {% if variant.available and variant.inventory_quantity > 0 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
            "price": {{ variant.price | json }},
            "sku": {{ variant.sku | json }},
            "title": {{ variant.title | json }},
            "priceText": {{ variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | json }},
            "compareAt": {{ variant.compare_at_price | json }},
            "compareText": {{ variant.compare_at_price | money_without_trailing_zeros | json }},
            "featuredMediaPosition": {{ variant.featured_media.position | default: 0 | json }}
          }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ],
      "symbol": {{ cart.currency.symbol | json }},
      "current": {{ current_variant.id | default: 0 }},
      "card": {
        "handle": {{ product.handle | json }},
        "title": {{ product.title | json }},
        "url": {{ product.url | json }},
        "image": {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 532 | json }}
      }
    }
  </script>
</product-page>

{% # carousel-scroll defines window.carouselScroll, which scroll-carousel calls %}
<script src="{{ 'carousel-scroll.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'scroll-carousel.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'product.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'video-showcase.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<script src="{{ 'curated-videos.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

